export anchor CleanAppStyle:
    number: 1
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Clean app
    idea: Calm white cards on a cool grey page, soft shadows and rounded pills that make the app feel light and friendly.
    base: light
    palette:
        page: #f5f7fa, the page background
        surface: #ffffff, cards, the sidebar and fields
        text: #1b2230, body text and headings
        muted: #5b6475, labels, dates and meta text
        border: #e3e7ee, field borders, the sidebar edge and progress tracks
        accent: #2563eb, links, primary buttons, progress fill and the focus ring
        accentSoft: #e8efff, the active nav item and icon tiles
        success: #17784a text on #e4f4eb, the On track pill
        warning: #965800 text on #fdf0d9, the At risk pill
        danger: #c0282d text on #fde7e8, the Behind pill and the overdue count
    type:
        System sans, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica
        Neue, Arial, sans-serif. Sizes are 28px bold for the page title,
        18px bold for section titles, 16px semibold for project names, 15px
        regular body at 1.5 line height, 13px muted meta and 12px semibold
        pills. Key numbers are 26px bold with tabular figures.
    layout:
        A white sidebar 232px wide with the brand and nav on the left. The
        main area has a top bar with search, notifications and the New
        project button, then the greeting, a row of four summary cards, and
        a two to one grid of project cards beside the chart and activity
        cards. Below 700px the sidebar becomes a sticky top bar with icon
        nav, and everything stacks in one column.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 16px gaps between cards, 20px card padding, 24 to 32px between sections.
    density: Roomy. About six project cards fill a wide screen.
    corners: 12px on cards, 8px on buttons and fields, fully round pills, progress bars and avatars.
    borders: 1px #e3e7ee on fields and the sidebar edge only. Cards have no border.
    shadows: Cards use 0 1px 2px plus 0 4px 12px, both rgba(16,24,40,0.06).
    icons:
        20px rounded line icons with a 1.8 stroke. Summary icons sit in
        40px soft tinted tiles. Status pills carry a circle tick, a warning
        triangle or an octagon. Team members show as coloured initial
        avatars.
    focus: A 3px outline in rgba(37,99,235,0.35) offset 2px. A focused field gets an accent border and a 3px soft ring.
    tone: Friendly sentence case, such as Good morning, Mara, and View all.
